# Skillfolio

A student portfolio builder.

## Problem
Students have projects, skills, certificates and resumes scattered in many places, so they can't show their work professionally.

## Solution
Skillfolio lets a student create one professional portfolio page in minutes.

## Features
- Add projects with description and links
- Add skills and certificates
- Upload or generate a resume
- Get a shareable portfolio page

## Tech
- Frontend: React
- Track: Skill Tank (EdTech)